        ["capstone-report", "Vision Evaluation and Portfolio", "Explain performance, condition-specific failures, privacy, intended use, and deployment limitations.", "Show predictions and errors as well as summary metrics; avoid overstating readiness.", "Publish an architecture, evaluation report, sample inputs and outputs, setup steps, and known limitations.", [["NIST AI RMF", "https://www.nist.gov/itl/ai-risk-management-framework", "documentation"]]]
